  "id": "net.replication-receive-work",
  "source": "docs/engine-guide.md#persistence-replay-and-networking",
  "statement": "Replication public calls share at most 1024 receive polls and a 256 KiB payload threshold plus one bounded frame across clients, admission control and nested refusals. Control-batch yields preserve closing links until commands, ACKs and authoritative snapshots drain. Send and receive capacities remain distinct and enforced. Clean-disconnect artifacts require terminal, non-desynced sessions. Native regressions are registered; execution and qualification remain pending.",
